        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumbaye yenye yakala kpwenye muhala wanjina nyuma ya iyo Baraza ya Uamuli na yadzengbwa dza zira zanjina. Selemani piya wadzenga nyumba dza iyo kpwa ajili ya mwana mchetu wa mfalume wa Misiri, ambaye kala akamlóla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madzengo higo gosi gadzengbwa kpwa mawe ga samani kula msingi hadi dzulu, mawe ambago kala gakatsongbwa kpwa vipimo virivyolagizwa na kukatwa kpwa msumeno uphande wa ndani na wa kondze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msingi wakala wa mawe ga samani na makulu genye ure wa mita 3.5 na ganjina mita 4. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu za dzulu zadzengbwa kpwa mawe ganjina garigotsongbwa kpwa vipimo virivyolagizwa na kpwa mbao za muerezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behewa kulu ra nyumba ya mfalume rakala na kuta zenye safu mwenga ya mbao za muerezi na safu tahu za mawe ga kutsongbwa. Ndivyo irivyokala hata kpwa mihala ya ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu na ukumbi wa nyumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona mfalume Selemani walagizira Hiramu kula mudzi wa Tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu kala ana ikima nyinji na marifwa, na kala ana ujuzi wa ufundi wa kazi zosi za shaba. Mfwadzi ise wa Hiramu wakala ni mfula-shaba kula mudzi wa Tiro na nine kala ni gungu wa mbari ya Nafutali. Phahi Hiramu wakpwedza kpwa mfalume Selemani, achimuhendera kazize zosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu watengeza nguzo mbiri za shaba, chila mwenga yakala na chimo cha mita nane na mzunguluko wa kama mita tsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achitengeza tadzi mbiri za shaba ili aziike dzulu ya vitswa vya hizo nguzo. Chila mwenga yakala na chimo cha mita 2.2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadzi hizo zirizokala dzulu ya nguzo zatiywa mapambo ga mraba-mraba gosukpwa dza mikufu. Chila tadzi yakala na mapambo sabaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana ga Chieburania ga chifungu hichi tagaeleweka vinono.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya watengeza makomamanga, achigapanga kpwa safu mbiri kuzunguluka zira tadzi dzulu ya chila nguzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tadzi hizo zokala dzulu ya nguzo hipho ukumbini, zachorwa maruwa, chimoche chakala kama mita 2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadzi hizo zakala dzulu ya hizo nguzo mbiri na piya zakala dzulu ya seemu ya mviringo uriodzitulukiza phephi na gara mapambo ga mraba-mraba. Kpwakala na mapambo ga makomamanga magana mairi gopangbwa safu mbiri kuzunguluka chila tadzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu waimisa nguzo hizo kpwenye baraza ya yo nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. Hira ya uphande wa mkpwono kulume wayiiha Jakini ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania dzina",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jakini",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mlungu anaimarisha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na hira ya uphande wa mkpwono kumotso achiyiiha Boazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania dzina",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Boazi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni sawa na kuamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ndaniye (yani ndani ya Mlungu) muna nguvu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Virere vya nguzo hizo vyapambwa kpwa maruwa. Na hivyo kazi ya kutengeza nguzo ichikamilika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona achitengeza birika ra mviringo ra shaba iriyoyayushwa, kula mkungo hadi mkungo mita 4.4, chimo cha mita 2.2 na kuizunguluka kabisa mviringowe ni mita 13.2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsini ya hinyo mkpwungowe, kurizunguluka birika hiro, kpwakala safu mbiri za viburu, chila chimwenga mita 4.4. Viburu hivyo kala vikatengezwa wakati uratu birika ririphotengezwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiro birika raimiswa dzulu ya miongo ya ngʼombe kumi na mbiri a shaba. Ahahu alola vurini, ahahu alola mwakani, ahahu alola mlairo wa dzuwa na ahahu alola mtswerero wa dzuwa. Vyo vyunu vya zo ngʼombe vyakala vinalola pho kahi-kahi ya ro birika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziho wa mkpwungowe wakala nchi ne. Nao wakala unaigana na mkpwungo wa chikombe na dza ruwa ra toro. Birika kala rinaweza kumenya madzi chiasi cha lita elufu mirongo mine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu piya watengeza magari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Magari higa kala ni dza magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kumi ga shaba, chila rukpwama kala rina ure wa mita 1.8, upana wa mita 1.8 na chimo cha mita 1.3. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marukpwama higo gaundwa hivi: kpwakala mabamba ambago gana mikungo yotiywa ndani ya mimo. Dzulu ya mabamba higo gotiywa ndani ya mimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwakala sanamu za simba, ndzau na makerubi. Sanamu hizo za simba na ndzau, kala zikabwiningizwa na kuchorwa mapambo garigosokotwa vinono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila rukpwama kala rina magurudumo mane ga shaba na vyuma vya kahi-kahi vya kugagbwiririra magurudumo higo, vyakala vya shaba. Kpwenye pembe ne za rukpwama kpwakala na mataruma ga shaba kpwa ajili ya kusikira birika kulu. Phephi ya chila taruma kpwaikpwa mapambo ga maruwa ga kusokotwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mryango wa rukpwama wakala katika seemu iriyotuluka dzulu kpwa chipimo cha kama nusu mita. Kpwa kondze, mryango wakala ukatiywa michoro na mabambage gakala ga mraba, si ga mviringo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na higo magurudumo mane gakala tsini ya gara mabamba. Vyuma vya kahi-kahi vya kugbwirira magurudumo kala vikagbwizanywa na rukpwama renye na chimoche kala ni zaidi ya nusu mita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higo magurudumo gakala dza magurudumo ga magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi na vyumavye vya kahi-kahi, rimuze za mviringo, ndziranize na mizinga, hivyo vyosi vyakala vya shaba iriyoyayushwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsini ya chila rukpwama kpwakala taruma ne kpwenye pembeze ne nazo zagbwizanywa na gari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na dzulu ya chila rukpwama kpwakala mkanda wa mviringo urio kala na ure wa phephi na robo ya mita kuphiya dzulu. Mataruma na masikiro gokala uphande wa dzulu gagbwizanywa na ro rukpwama renye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwenye nafwasi wazi iriyophahikana kahi ya taruma na masikiro ga chila rukpwama, Hiramu watsonga michoro ya makerubi, simba na mitende, achiizungulusira misokoto ya mapambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo ndivyo waunda magari kumi, gachikala na chimo chimwenga na umbo ra kuigana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
